MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

We can start by
  y_t = x_t + e_t
  x_t = r x_{t-1} + w_t
and them re-write the state equation as
  0 = x_t - r x_{t-1} - w_t
and in this last equation we have weights
  1 for x_t
 -1 for x_{t-1}
 -1 for w_t

